  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Engaging Gagauzian Youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pilot project is a partnership between Youth of Gagauzia (Moldova) and Silba  Initiative for Dialogue and Democracy (Denmark). The aim of the project is to foster and support youth engagement in the Gagauzia region in Southern Moldova. This is done by creating an informal education program for youth community leaders in different parts of the region. Throughout the training program the participating youth will be taught tools to 1) analyse the challenges facing youth in their area and 2) create youth-to-youth activities that are addressing these challenges. These activities carried out by youth can be supported by micro grants.</narrative>
  </description>
